# armour/woman/leather: boiled / studded leather cut to the woman (P2c slice; re-shaded by LADDER-ARMOUR for value, STYLE_P2
# 25.2-25.3, 27.5 C14): the man's jerkin with her waist a pixel narrower and ONE step-1 row across the chest; a broad lit
# plane at the top-left with one step-4 shine on the lit shoulder, a step-1 shadow side, a DARK belt band with its buckle
# and a SOLID LIT HEM, so the leather parts from her trousers and from the cloth at the collar. Studs: `when studs`.
# Finish regions: R the hem, P the chest's lit plane, G a stud socket, N the chest seam, W a 2x2 spot on the shadow side.
# Keys: rest idle run runl drawn swing lie in D U R L. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. Source: LADDER-ARMOUR's expand.py.
use person
body woman
role armour leather
layer torso
anchor neck
keys torso
z 2

